指揮角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"中郞將龐雄爲副","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"75a97d58-247f-407b-bdab-9a6ed0c9326b"},{"confidence":0.87,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"遼東太守","official_note":"遼東太守是漢代遼東郡的地方行政長官，負責治理和防禦，此處耿夔率領鮮卑和其他郡兵參與攻擊南匈奴，顯示其在邊境軍事行動中的領導作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"又詔遼東太守耿夔率鮮卑及諸郡共擊之","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"218a1f5f-c13c-46a8-beb8-e0e48c509cf3"},{"confidence":0.86,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"度遼將軍","official_note":"度遼將軍是漢代專門負責遼東地區防務的軍事將領，此處梁慬代理此職，參與對南匈奴的軍事行動，強調其在邊境防禦中的職責。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以梁慬行度遼將軍事","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"2bd819da-889f-4871-acc9-2661010f9dc6"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","people_xingming":"挛鞮檀","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95ce322f-db0e-11ef-8c25-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[挛鞮檀]"},{"people_name":"耿种","people_name_jianti_auto":"耿种","people_xingming":"耿种","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"95ce3230-db0e-11ef-8a5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":110,"link_td_description":"何熙，字孟孙，陈国阳夏县（今河南省太康县）人，东汉军事人物。","link_td_id":"Q10020229","link_td_number_id":6185588,"people_name":"何熙","people_name_jianti_auto":"何熙","people_xingming":"何熙","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"95ce3232-db0e-11ef-a5df-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"龐雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"庞雄","people_xingming":"庞雄","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"95ce3233-db0e-11ef-893f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"耿夔，字定公，扶风郡茂陵（陕西省咸阳市西）人，东汉将领。","link_td_id":"Q10007344","link_td_number_id":4551862,"people_name":"耿夔","people_name_jianti_auto":"耿夔","people_xingming":"耿夔","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"95ce3234-db0e-11ef-9df8-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":112,"link_td_description":"梁慬，字伯威，戈居（故城在今甘肃省宁县西南）人。东汉名将。","link_td_id":"Q10007714","link_td_number_id":1296519,"people_name":"梁慬","people_name_jianti_auto":"梁慬","people_xingming":"梁慬","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"95ce3238-db0e-11ef-ba0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雄","people_name_jianti_auto"