]。","context_before":"...年，诏南匈奴徙居西河美稷之虎泽，亦即此泽也。盖境相接矣。","source_end_index":134,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"67db45a1-e0d4-52e6-b5bd-9f2abf7dccee","source_start_index":80,"source_text":"后汉永初三年，南单于反，围中郎将耿种于美稷。四年，梁瑾等击之于属国故城南，单于败还虎泽。汉复攻之，单于乞降。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"12南單于圍中郞將耿种於美稷。冬，十一月，以大司農陳國何熙行車騎將軍事，中郞將龐雄爲副，將五營及邊郡兵二萬餘人，又詔遼東太守耿夔率鮮卑及諸郡共擊之。以梁慬行度遼將軍事。雄、夔擊南匈奴薁鞬日逐王，破之。","content_fanyi":"南匈奴单于在美稷县包围了中郎将耿种。冬季，十一月，任命大司农陈国人何熙代理车骑将军事务，并让中郎将庞雄为副职，统率五营兵和边郡兵共二万多人；又下诏命令辽东郡太守耿夔率领鲜卑兵及诸郡兵共同攻击来犯的南匈奴军。又任命梁慬代理度辽将军事务。庞雄、耿夔进攻南匈奴薁鞬日逐王，击败了他们。","content_jianti_auto":"12南单于围中郞将耿种于美稷。冬，十一月，以大司农陈国何熙行车骑将军事，中郞将庞雄为副，将五营及边郡兵二万余人，又诏辽东太守耿夔率鲜卑及诸郡共击之。以梁慬行度辽将军事。雄、夔击南匈奴薁鞬日逐王，破之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3999,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"95ce3225-db0e-11ef-8166-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"13十二月，辛酉，郡國九地震。","content_fanyi":"十二月初五辛酉日，有九个郡国发生地震。","content_jianti_auto":"13十二月，辛酉，郡国九地震。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4000,"number":13,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95cf3028-db0e-11ef-8fe4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉書·天文志：天苑十六星在昴、畢南，天子之苑囿，養獸之所也。孛，蒲內翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋书·天文志：天苑十六星在昴、毕南，天子之苑囿，养兽之所也。孛，蒲内翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95cf302a-db0e-11ef-9247-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"14乙亥，有星孛于天苑。","content_fanyi":"十二月十九日乙亥，天苑星区出现了异星。","content_jianti_auto":"14乙亥，有星孛于天苑。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4001,"number":14,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95cf3029-db0e-11ef-a4ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"95cf302d-db0e-11ef-a9a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷","resolved_place_entity_id":186,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"95cf302e-db0e-11ef-84c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"95cf302f-db0e-11ef-811d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"15是歲，京師及郡國四十一雨水，幷、涼二州大飢，人相食。","content_fanyi":"这一年，京城洛阳及四十一个郡国雨水成灾，并州、凉州发生大饥荒，出现人吃人的惨状。","content_jianti_auto":"15是岁，京师及郡国四十一雨水，幷、凉二州大饥，人相食。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4002,"number":15,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"95cf302c-db0e-11ef-a68c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西都","place_name_jianti_auto":"西都","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95cf3033-db0e-11ef-acd5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"端門","place_name_jianti_auto":"端门","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"95cf3034-db0e-11ef-80c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"西都之制，歲盡，衞卒交代，上臨饗罷遣之。續漢志曰：饗遣故衞士儀：百官會，位定，謁者持節引故衞士入自端門，衞司馬執幡鉦護行。行定，侍御史持節慰勞，以詔恩問所疾苦，受其章奏所欲言。畢，饗賜作樂，觀以角抵。樂闋，罷遣，勸以農桑。","note_content_jianti_auto":"西都之制，岁尽，衞卒交代，上临飨罢遣之。续汉志曰：飨遣故衞士仪：百官会，位定，谒者持节引故衞士入自端门，衞司马执幡钲护行。行定，侍御史持节慰劳，以诏恩问所疾苦，受其章奏所欲言。毕，飨赐作乐，观以角抵。乐阕，罢遣，劝以农桑。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"95cf3032-db0e-11ef-b2e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95cf3037-db0e-11ef-b8b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薛綜","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛综","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"95cf3038-db0e-11ef-b06d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：侲子，逐疫之人也，音振。薛綜註西京賦云：侲之言善也，善，童幼子也。續漢書曰：大儺，選中黃門子弟年十歲以上、十二以下百二十人爲侲子，皆赤幘皁製，執大鞉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：侲子，逐疫之人也，音振。薛综注西京赋云：侲之言善也，善，童幼子也。续汉书曰：大傩，选中黄门子弟年十岁以上、十二以下百二十人为侲子，皆赤帻皂制，执大鞉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"95cf3036-db0e-11ef-87ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"95cf3030-db0e-11ef-bcaf-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhèn","source_anchor_text":"樂減逐疫侲子之半春","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":31,"text":"侲","tongjian_id":"84ae0dc4-ac0f-5ce1-b6ea-280afbe21744"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"16太后以陰陽不和，軍旅數興，詔歲終饗遣衞士勿設戲作樂，減逐疫侲子之半。","content_fanyi":"邓太后认为天地阴阳失和，又值战事屡次发生，下诏：年终设宴遣送更代卫士时，不再安排游戏和奏乐；把大傩仪式中逐疫侲子的人数减去一半。","content_jianti_auto":"16太后以阴阳不和，军旅数兴，诏岁终飨遣衞士勿设戏作乐，减逐疫侲子之半。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4003,"number":16,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"95cf3030-db0e-11ef-bcaf-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"三年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"三年","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95cbe866-db0e-11ef-a092-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（己酉、一○九）","year_int":109},"message":"success","success":true}